<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns three secondary auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns three secondary auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico has completed all three auctions it had offered in the secondary market.</p>
<p>    CREDIT AUCTIONS  TERM     AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    470    million pesos 16 days  22.80 pct</p>
<p>    470    million pesos  8 days  22.49 pct</p>
<p>    251    million pesos  1 days  21.58 pct</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500))</p>
</text>
